  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nWays to Support Us\n\nNow more than ever it is crucial that we raise additional funds in order to survive. While we largely rely on visitors to the museum, there are many other way you can support Soldiers of Oxfordshire Trust in our work preserving the county's military heritage, including the many personal stories and objects in our museum and archives.\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Trust in a Registered Charity, no. 1145408\n\nDownload our Impact Report for 2024\nMake a Donation\nDonate Online\n\nMake an individual or regular donation online through the Charities Aid Foundation\n\nDonate by Text\n\nText SOLDIERS followed by your donation amount to 70450 to give that amount.\n\nFind out more about Text Giving.\n\nDonate by Post\n\nCheques can posted to us at:\n\nSOFO Museum\nHarrison's Lane\nWoodstock, Oxfordshire\nOX20 1SS\n\nPlease make cheques payable to 'Soldiers of Oxfordshire Museum'.\n\nLend Us a Hand\nBecome a Volunteer\n\nJoin the team as a volunteer\n\nBecome a Friend\n\nJoin the Friends of the Soldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\n\nBecome an Ambassador\n\nHelp us spread the word\n\nOther Ways to Support Us\nThe Military Family Tree\n\nCommemorate your relative at the museum\n\nGrants and Corporate Sponsors\n\nJoin the organisations  and businesses who have supported us\n\nLeave a Legacy\n\nFind out more about In Memoriam donations\n\nShop with SOFO\n\nAny purchase you make in our Gift Shop or via our website store supports the museum, but you can also support the museum when shopping elsewhere - at no cost to you!\n\n \nDid you know you can help Soldiers of Oxfordshire Trust while you do your online shopping? Simply go to www.easyfundraising.co.uk and create an account. Choose SOFO Trust as your charity and whenever you shop with one of their partner retailers, SOFO receives a donation. It really is as easy as that. The best bit is it doesn't cost you a penny!\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
